WEBVTT

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:04.840
This is the singularity... one day at a time.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:10.520
Here's the last 24 hours in AI. Sorry... SI.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.270
Europe just went big: Mistral unveiled Large 4, nicknamed Le Chonk.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:24.710
1.05 trillion parameters. Open weights due this month.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:29.260
And China? 16 new models in one month, says Nikkei.

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:35.180
The Justice Department told staff: out with artificial intelligence,

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:36.920
in with super intelligence.

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:42.810
In Sydney, OpenAI told Australia's AI inquiry its response was not good enough.

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:47.910
OpenAI and Anthropic said they'd back mandatory reporting of AI agent breaches.

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:51.720
Anthropic is opening Claude Mythos to more cyber defenders,

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:53.380
with three access tiers.

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:58.790
And Meta, Walmart and Stripe published an open standard for personal AI agents.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.330
Money check: DeepSeek is reportedly raising at least $12 billion,

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:06.400
possibly close to $15 billion.

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:12.680
OpenAI is reportedly after $30 billion, at about a $1.4 trillion valuation.

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:17.490
SpaceX reportedly wants $40 billion to buy Nvidia chips.

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:23.140
And Lambda's reportedly raising up to $4 billion, ahead of a 2027 IPO.

00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:24.240
And chips?

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:30.090
AMD's Lisa Su: we're going to substantially increase our supply in 2027.

00:01:30.470 --> 00:01:35.670
Meanwhile, OpenAI posted 722 math papers from an unreleased model,

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:37.400
many machine-checked.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:41.740
Multiply Labs raised $75 million for drug-making robots,

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:44.310
claiming 74% lower cost per dose.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:50.030
The catch? South Korea's president says AI appears to have been used to hack banks,

00:01:50.030 --> 00:01:51.180
and wants a probe.

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:56.120
Jamie Dimon says AI cyber risk went up 10-fold after Mythos.

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:58.370
So... is it so over?

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:00.450
We're so back!

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:04.970
Boston Dynamics' new CEO is Rohit Prasad,

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:08.440
Amazon's former Alexa and AGI head scientist.

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:12.090
Minerva Humanoids raised $10 million for Roger,

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:14.670
a VR-steered robot for bomb disposal.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:19.430
Bridge Neurotech raised $13.5 million for an ultrasound brain interface,

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:21.330
something close to headphones.

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:26.830
And to power it all, Google signed for 3.6 gigawatts from Constellation,

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:28.360
including new nuclear.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.370
Every day, the curve gets steeper.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.970
Every day, the future shows up a little earlier.

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:41.030
That was 24 hours. Tomorrow will be faster.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:48.250
This has been the singularity, one day at a time.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:50.080
Feel the SI.
